{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"EZK","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"以西結書","commonName":"以西結書","title":"以西結書","order":26,"numberOfChapters":48,"sha256":"12baf83f738d213fc8fcfdfb80ed9077bac361d38fc0165824d98cb7b59e53b9","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EZK/1.json","lastChapterNumber":48,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EZK/48.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1270},"chapter":{"number":28,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["斥責泰爾王"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和華的話又臨到我說："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["「人子啊，你對泰爾君王說，主耶和華如此說：",{"text":"因你心裏高傲，說：我是神；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我在海中坐神之位。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你雖然居心自比神，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不過是人，並不是神！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看哪，你比但以理更有智慧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"甚麼祕事都不能向你隱藏。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你靠自己的智慧聰明得了金銀財寶，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"收入庫中。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你靠自己的大智慧和貿易增添資財，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又因資財心裏高傲。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以主耶和華如此說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因你居心自比神，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必使外邦人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是列國中的強暴人臨到你這裏；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必拔刀砍壞你用智慧得來的美物，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"褻瀆你的榮光。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必使你下坑；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必死在海中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"與被殺的人一樣。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在殺你的人面前你還能說「我是神」嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"其實你在殺害你的人手中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不過是人，並不是神。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必死在外邦人手中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"與未受割禮","poem":1},{"noteId":28},{"text":"的人一樣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為這是主耶和華說的。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["泰爾王的終局"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["耶和華的話臨到我說："]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["「人子啊，你為泰爾王作起哀歌，說主耶和華如此說：",{"text":"你無所不備，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"智慧充足，全然美麗。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你曾在伊甸上帝的園中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"佩戴各樣寶石，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是紅寶石、紅璧璽、金鋼石、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"水蒼玉、紅瑪瑙、碧玉、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"藍寶石、綠寶石、紅玉，和黃金；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又有精美的鼓笛在你那裏，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都是在你受造之日預備齊全的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你是那受膏遮掩約櫃的基路伯；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我將你安置在上帝的聖山上；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你在發光如火的寶石中間往來。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你從受造之日所行的都完全，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"後來在你中間又察出不義。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因你貿易很多，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就被強暴的事充滿，以致犯罪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以我因你褻瀆聖地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就從上帝的山驅逐你。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"遮掩約櫃的基路伯啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我已將你從發光如火的寶石中除滅。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你因美麗心中高傲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又因榮光敗壞智慧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我已將你摔倒在地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你倒在君王面前，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好叫他們目睹眼見。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你因罪孽眾多，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"貿易不公，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就褻瀆你那裏的聖所。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"故此，我使火從你中間發出，燒滅你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你在所有觀看的人眼前變為地上的爐灰。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"各國民中，凡認識你的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都必為你驚奇。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你令人驚恐，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不再存留於世，直到永遠。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["斥責西頓"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"text":"耶和華的話臨到我說：","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"text":"「人子啊，你要向西頓預言攻擊她，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"text":"說主耶和華如此說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"西頓哪，我與你為敵，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必在你中間得榮耀。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我在你中間施行審判、顯為聖的時候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人就知道我是耶和華。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必使瘟疫進入西頓，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使血流在她街上。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被殺的必在其中仆倒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"四圍有刀劍臨到她，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人就知道我是耶和華。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["以色列要蒙福"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["「四圍恨惡以色列家的人，必不再向他們作刺人的荊棘，傷人的蒺藜，人就知道我是主耶和華。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":["主耶和華如此說：「我將分散在萬民中的以色列家招聚回來，向他們在列邦人眼前顯為聖的時候，他們就在我賜給我僕人雅各之地，仍然居住。"]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":["他們要在這地上安然居住。我向四圍恨惡他們的眾人施行審判以後，他們要蓋造房屋，栽種葡萄園，安然居住，就知道我是耶和華－他們的上帝。」"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":28,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：不潔；下同","reference":{"chapter":28,"verse":10}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EZK/28.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EZK/29.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EZK/27.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":26}